<title>USA: American Eagle Outfitters Inc Q3 profit.</title>
<headline>American Eagle Outfitters Inc Q3 profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARRENDALE, Pa. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(AMOUNTS IN MILLIONS EXCEPT PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>			  Third Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Nov. 2, Oct. 28,     Nov. 2, Oct. 28</p>
<p>			    1996    1995	    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	     $78.8   $85.8(1)	$203.5   $199.6(1)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)     2.1    (1.4)(2)	 (0.5)    (9.9)(2)</p>
<p> Share Income (Loss)   0.21   (0.14)(2)	(0.05)   (0.99)(2)</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding	   10.3    10.0	     10.1     10.0</p>
<p>(1) Includes sales of $8.7 and $21.5 million for the quarter and nine months ended October 28, 1995 respectively from outlet stores that were sold in October 1995.</p>
<p>(2) Includes a net loss of $1.9 million, or $0.19 per share, in connection with the sale of the net assets of the 32 outlet stores as of the close of business on October 28, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
